"⟪k:66⟫⟪k:67⟫⟪k:68⟫⟪k:69⟫⟪k:70⟫⟪k:71⟫⟪k:72⟫⟪k:73⟫⟪k:74⟫⟪k:75⟫⟪k:76⟫⟪k:77⟫⟪k:78⟫⟪k:79⟫⟪k:80⟫⟪k:81⟫"
"⟪k:82⟫⟪k:83⟫⟪k:84⟫⟪k:85⟫⟪k:86⟫⟪k:87⟫⟪k:88⟫⟪k:89⟫⟪k:90⟫⟪k:91⟫⟪k:92⟫⟪k:93⟫⟪k:94⟫⟪k:95⟫⟪k:96⟫⟪k:97⟫"
"⟪k:98⟫J’avais quitté la capitale depuis plusieurs jours."

#: scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c324c79c6a7c0dafaab9c6d6dfe322e5f28e020a3d809089b27f6773409007d
#. default-sha256: f8a6adea7fab0b948d53a5d1f76de7e1ea6d9a7097bcdb438159e40cbda1692d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and I could still see it when I closed my eyes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the people lined up on the Grand-"
"Pont, awaiting entry, eager to start a new life there. Brimming with hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand je fermais les yeux, je revoyais constamment la scène—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ les gens alignés sur "
"le Grand Pont, attendant de pouvoir entrer, impatients de débuter une nouvelle vie là-bas. "
"Remplis d’espoir."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad11ee9b558748c2f5d32ac4db02e6de6c7366ed0c3a593717392a96e83e975c
#. default-sha256: fd7357ad392e06c6ad2405867f41a742568e3437d9911639d4b5c86ff4fe1d60
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a city people were willing to pay high taxes to live in. ⟪k:1⟫If you were a "
"performer, you could get some of those costs shaved down a bit by putting those skills to use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour pouvoir vivre dans cette ville, les gens étaient prêts à payer des impôts élevés. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Si l’on était un artiste, on pouvait en diminuer un peu le prix en mettant son talent à "
"contribution."

#: scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ac0f80fa4130f99eed0b5bffa2b1500609417f593bb397537e82f895ab38d2a
#. default-sha256: 73f02824d2b6b278a659fde206cbf52466ac055737e699cfde68098fd5578485
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The capital was harsh on those who wanted in, and apathetic about all who left."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La capitale exigeait beaucoup de ceux qui voulaient y habiter et à l’inverse se montrait "
"indifférente envers ceux qui en partaient."

#: scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48914bf065e4a151f94282d86130742f02162e5b50eeecfe590c9fff190097f1
#. default-sha256: 62234ee00e9b996e679b625a0a488832dbde500b8adf95aa8e4989c48f71713f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was composed of a powerful nobility and clergy,⟪k:1⟫wealthy merchants and bankers, and a "
"large population of poor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And it was the city I had called home for a long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle était composée d’une noblesse et d’un clergé puissants,⟪k:1⟫de riches marchands et "
"banquiers et d’une grande majorité de pauvres.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Et c’était ma ville natale, là où je me "
"sentais chez moi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad02318793b066f94bf60a38fd6635d6f4b13deefeb64021b46718c328523304
#. default-sha256: 0f1224c712bdaafd81ead696000a5e2fd11d559852766026718a8b44897581e8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know much about where I was heading."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne savais pas vraiment où j’allais."

#: scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50088b5cf724f7c37377cf5d5ab2f3456f484364ee90fadc6920bcdeb23a27ca
#. default-sha256: dd6196dc77c3f2c7214f781cf9faebc1028af7a7dc1d3da8f1eca8d824a85841
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s getting foggy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Looks like it might rain..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le brouillard s’installe.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫On dirait qu’il va pleuvoir..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fce765301914b759f92d5d4379ece8ff2dcc66f1acf09d402ee5ffc8286fe87f
#. default-sha256: 163b2e323d535264457bde6e881f6b6c49fb475fcdc64b533a7842648f5d5d0c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe we should take a little break.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You want to keep going? ⟪k:3⟫Oh... ⟪k:4⟫all "
"right, then."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On devrait peut-être faire une petite pause.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous voulez continuer ? ⟪k:3⟫Ah... "
"⟪k:4⟫très bien."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c262bb95f46e5f26c7fdf5995015a1f637ad4d3f3eda967c54707da27a6b329
#. default-sha256: f68772fc72f35fb6786c4e1372b9dec58c5ecb4d243c1916320edaded235606b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The coachman was frustratingly taciturn.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He acted as though he had gotten stuck "
"transporting a prisoner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le cocher n’était pas du genre bavard— c’était frustrant.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il se comportait comme si "
"on lui avait refilé une prisonnière à transporter."

#: scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dbc17741350d5a41e8518eea2077216ffc4bc2005cee5afb5d0e165c31c2c07
#. default-sha256: 0ac8b7542a4d379467049b7ce1af3893fc995990af99a53b2dd12fd106e1548e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though that was hardly a stretch.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his point of view, I was nothing more than a "
"criminal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il n’avait pas tout à fait tort.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫De son point de vue, je n’étais rien d’autre "
"qu’une criminelle."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9c39739d451f96b62ca1a58ab4923a009000ab7faae4c9012bb757868617ac0
#. default-sha256: 9462961945948cbe1994124a7235303445eab14cf69174fc5cc0c15a6f027408
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the times he ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ acknowledge I had said anything,⟪k:3⟫he made no effort to "
"hide the scorn in his eyes—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même lorsqu’il daignait reconnaître que j’avais dit quelque chose,⟪k:1⟫il ne faisait aucun "
"effort pour dissimuler le mépris que je lui inspirais—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_466146D6_F1B1_6580_2D64_293899220B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c04aeb63b90c039097afe544d74bd02a9b7bc1f811ec27b5b3e3e46009243a42
#. default-sha256: f296a1ea97ff7d4a83d4677330172ec2565ed56a043ffd30b30f63d8b3b21d9c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_466146D6_F1B1_6580_2D64_293899220B4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫to pretend he didn’t regret ever taking this job."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫pour bien me faire comprendre qu’il regrettait d’avoir accepté cette tâche."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bc85bc8833f3daa5c167c43f6276268467036a808b01aa6d93432493c57031b
#. default-sha256: 06cef2a45db5edaf1c20171a6f21059b5e94b6752b0cda5b8180d3e0753f3e95
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I would just fall silent again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je retombais donc dans mon silence."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c3e7dddf23ad3d96351e3a9af5d9a1932a86a9030927e0a529814537ac7f7a9
#. default-sha256: e378768797dc289ca26a9e0f409e7ad8da421b721006e50359cfbed965a1d925
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The road was gradually getting narrower. ⟪k:1⟫We had long since left the paved city roads "
"behind, and were now traveling along a couple worn-down grooves in the forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La route se rétrécissait peu à peu. ⟪k:1⟫Nous avions quitté depuis longtemps les routes "
"pavées de la ville et nous nous trouvions à présent sur les chemins cahoteux de la forêt."

#: scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6dfc7ed11d3313030a11b42137daa5683b88ffd14ca0e024b68f08c8d8c6176
#. default-sha256: c896d017313a205406ee144af4e4bb4950ce3c2e88783844efcfca33ba2b9a1a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did I end up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comment en étais-je arrivée là ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f84f9000975a3e632b499e4992876f5d5ad3ca8b0d8ab5bcc1ce20b5625d511
#. default-sha256: c933da348599640bfb5a12d2e1088c25328cf0d6a3f92e0fd30e2cb38180ce25
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I being subjected to this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pourquoi me faisait-on subir cela ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8b1d3d59fab095b119d3f8cd007865f0d99c85ce8a0b8bc863ab2e7188d19fc
#. default-sha256: f93026c732541f4ae44afae6af850bdf5dd006713180c5df18ab44b4d1d00a21
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was done thinking about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’en avais assez, je ne voulais plus y penser."

#: scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaa9460885c23eab15870566271e04fb9e89c7ec72e220ef14c024916250a5b2
#. default-sha256: b2ffd8f0a81565a86d22d9161df9ac0c5cdaf90087a1be3a7951aabaf9a3b450
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more I thought on it, the less fair it seemed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The more I remembered, the worse "
"it hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Plus j’y réfléchissais, plus je trouvais ça injuste.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Raviver ces souvenirs m’était "
"trop douloureux."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd0b5dc7a3525e5d9752d8c4a5a04ec373a98672bbf3b4655109d92c1ef0c596
#. default-sha256: 998184bd71c112fdf74a723cdd02785a04b971cacf8b81cc44a6b1f4213fbe6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I could do anymore was close my eyes and weather the storm."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il ne me restait qu’à fermer les yeux et affronter la tempête."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 155ff338bea6b92d3406a2f34602e1450f5f01644295ac6ddbe82daa290a1f05
#. default-sha256: 621c33362114dc56a989380153a25c94d8c59a9ef171ea9f7b6c9172eb07a2b7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep within the dense woods, a mansion appeared before us like the world fading into view "
"after a dream."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En plein cœur de la forêt apparut devant nous un manoir, tel le monde réapparaissant après "
"un rêve."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A799B4C7_858A_400E_BCC4_6CAF6CD70413
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
