msgid "⟪k:0⟫This deep in the forest?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Aussi loin dans la forêt ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C490A16F_85CA_4E34_9DE0_E0DD31A4FD62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8317171449bc974d83af0ee18bfb041e2a300244063dbc7558b6ae2d61fa19f0
