#: scenario5:scenario5_486A044B_3F25_4FFA_87D2_B333912CED00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ffa5a665744a1e7f41c3e9c40b60773908b634581771c39507e3b1f6d26a767
