msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But the driver didn’t even acknowledge me, getting back onto the carriage and setting "
"off into the forest. ⟪k:2⟫He seemed to want to get as far away from here as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais le chauffeur ne me prêta pas la moindre attention, il remonta dans la voiture et "
"repartit dans les bois. ⟪k:2⟫On aurait dit qu’il voulait s’éloigner le plus vite possible de cet "
"endroit."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0EB7448_EA84_49D4_B720_AB7239CE0533
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 611b71e4898bf2bab088dc52571030285aeabeecd7bbf599652733d573e99a6c
