#: scenario5:scenario5_7068D54F_ADBB_4B9F_AEC7_BD17DD1FE0D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e352a85dbeb76e9128e69ef383b336256f12fd7a0fc182e298587d5fd8917a8
