msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The door was heavy, and though it seemed to protest my attempts to "
"enter, it still opened much easier than I was expecting. ⟪k:5⟫I was worried over nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La porte était lourde et même si elle semblait protester contre mes "
"tentatives pour entrer, elle s’ouvrait bien plus facilement que je ne m’y attendais. ⟪k:5⟫Je m’en "
"faisais pour rien."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E96A4D5_B182_48CD_A393_D3FE2E56272F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd969b1588f3583b58784c63005c4008a7754f38ab61bd29298f38620acad637
#. default-sha256: 41af4775c26b15b227213ce8a24f80474b56c7f6f783a39ca7c921336432e14e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E96A4D5_B182_48CD_A393_D3FE2E56272F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking in, I got the strangest impression that light was being swallowed up into the "
"mansion’s depths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En jetant un coup d’œil à l’intérieur, j’eus le sentiment étrange que la lumière avait été "
"avalée par les profondeurs du manoir."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3F907F55_0D51_441D_A556_94B54A631800
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 809820b4a85329d61bd855979d8ce81b1a1df26d0dfa8d326b737f7c10a35101
#. default-sha256: 53892b4e70898c7c247608bbe53122049d2860ae923254302c84dee26114694e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3F907F55_0D51_441D_A556_94B54A631800"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rather than going ⟪k:1⟫inside⟪k:2⟫, it felt as though I was about to step outside the "
"boundaries of this world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je n’avais pas l’impression ⟪k:1⟫d’entrer⟪k:2⟫ mais plutôt de faire un pas hors des limites "
"de ce monde."

#: scenario5:scenario5_25B6144A_65A8_4DD9_99AC_EB85CDC4080B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81aaafc0dcd947fe9bcc6d6aaa1eb07488768376c61fbff79a762f73c9f94c90
