msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫When I closed the door, it "
"was so dark I couldn’t even tell where I was walking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Quand je refermai la porte, "
"il faisait si sombre que je ne voyais même pas où je marchais."

#: scenario5:scenario5_16AF63CF_68EA_4DDB_8B19_97AFC13E8226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 623ecb4a144cd7237f629aafe4805ca2702056861699009e5eeea4cf21b6eba6
#. default-sha256: 0cb08a93f3a25db365c6dd28bc5619b4bc2ccc1d1781be2e4690aa1654096d69
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_16AF63CF_68EA_4DDB_8B19_97AFC13E8226"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wonder... ⟪k:2⟫if the windows open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je me demande... ⟪k:2⟫si les fenêtres s’ouvrent."

#: scenario5:scenario5_AA15CF14_500D_4B38_AF57_947AC84E078C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f00dd6c1c83b6fb8dafc4b42294d912d25a4ee841b41024a2cc5a5cac0b47e11
#. default-sha256: aafc4436ce630aa58f69f0bd2307d12ea54a75df48da82316d210623a322cbfc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_AA15CF14_500D_4B38_AF57_947AC84E078C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though I managed to fumble my way over to a window, it was tightly shuttered, and the "
"shutters caked with rust.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was probably not getting it open without a fight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’arrivai tant bien que mal à me faufiler à tâtons jusqu’à la fenêtre mais elle était "
"hermétiquement fermée et les volets étaient couverts de rouille.⟪k:1⟫ Je ne réussirais pas à les "
"ouvrir sans m’acharner."

#: scenario5:scenario5_708F7434_8D11_4346_B7E3_BC379E0CC7CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
