msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fighting back that fear, I slowly walked forward, tracing the wall with my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ravalai ma peur et avançai doucement, tout en suivant le contour du mur de la main."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F5D7FD38_6FA8_4927_8806_A282F02466B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 333c7abde582f6269a96c14ae098a3b4b4f2ccec68f5dee6f9528211d8686e09
