msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was a door at the end of a long corridor. I pulled it open, and a wisp of "
"bone-chilling air brushed past me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il y avait une porte au bout d’un long couloir. Je l’ouvris et un courant d’air "
"glacial me donna la chair de poule."

#: scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b099b21b6bf5c5e537d9467808b823a576d1d57d4dfb41a510e3eed5a75c2cc4
