#: scenario5:scenario5_ABC7108B_5CEF_427A_85D9_E2261981A91B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d4cc1da8056f94bcba6754bba9a2b93a031c4db721b6d2828833a8884970ac7
